{"sections":[{"slug":"相对对偶层","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"相对对偶层"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">相对对偶层</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“相对对偶层”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>.</p>\n<p>(Artan <span lang=\"zh\">讲的</span>)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X \\overset{f}{\\to} Y \\overset{g}{\\to} Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">是局部</span> Noether <span lang=\"zh\">概形之间的映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $f,g,gf$ <span lang=\"zh\">每个映射光滑或为局部完全相交</span> (local complete intersection), <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\n\\omega_{X/Z} \\overset{\\simeq}{\\to} f^*\\omega_{Y/Z}\\otimes\\omega_{X/Y}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Poincaré--Verdier对偶","text":"Poincaré–Verdier <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对偶对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}